# SE-011: Clarification and dissolution are different reasons for a clear liquid
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100g
add v1 SiO2 0.1g
grind v1 SiO2 2um
centrifuge v1 2000rpm 60s 10cm 100.1g
inspect v1
new
add v2 water 100g
add v2 NaCl 0.1g
measure v1 eyes
measure v2 eyes
measure v2 conductivity
inspect
